        "description": "# Only available on Meta Quest 3 and Meta Quest 3S.\n\n**Batman: Arkham Shadow is included with the purchase of Meta Quest 3 and Meta Quest 3S.**\n\nBecome The Knight in this groundbreaking entry into the famed Arkham series.\n \nIt’s the Fourth of July, and Gotham City is under attack by a new threat: the mysterious Rat King and his cultish devotees. As widespread rioting engulfs the city, Batman races to prevent this so-called “Day of Wrath” before it all goes wrong.\n \n**Experience the World of Batman Like Never Before**\n\nImmerse yourself in all the grit of Gotham City with the power of VR, and take down its most notorious criminals.\n\n{558705893310462}\n\n**Hard-Hitting Arkham Combat**\n\nMade exclusively for VR—choose from fan favorite gadgets and bold fighting styles.\n\n{903574897963737}\n\n**Friends, Foes and Other Familiar Faces**\n\nMeet Dr. Quinzel and Dr. Crane before they became Harley Quinn and The Scarecrow, as well as other iconic characters including Harvey Dent, Ratcatcher, and Jim Gordon.\n\n{1281007706224317}",
